              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload 2/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>image</strong> { <a href=\"imageWrapperType\">ImageWrapper</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 图片或图片路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ options = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"#barcodeoptions\">BarcodeOptions</a> } - 识别选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#c-wrappedbarcode\">WrappedBarcode</a><a href=\"dataTypes#array\">[]</a> } - 全部识别结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别指定图片并始终返回数组.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let results = barcode.detectAll(&quot;./codes.png&quot;, {\n    format: [ &quot;CODE_128&quot;, &quot;EAN_13&quot; ],\n});\n\nresults.forEach((result) =&gt; {\n    console.log(`${result.getFormatName()}: ${result.getRawValue()}`);\n});\n</code></pre>\n",
