        {
          "textRaw": "BarcodeOptions",
          "name": "barcodeoptions",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>[ format = [] ]</strong> { <a href=\"#barcodeformat\">BarcodeFormat</a> | <a href=\"#barcodeformat\">BarcodeFormat</a><a href=\"dataTypes#array\">[]</a> } - 要识别的条码格式, 空数组表示全部格式</li>\n<li><strong>[ enableAllPotentialBarcodes = false ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否返回尚无可解码值的潜在条码</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>enableAllPotentialBarcodes</code> 为 <code>true</code> 时, 结果的原始值和显示值可能为 <code>null</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "BarcodeOptions"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "BarcodeSelectionOptions",
          "name": "barcodeselectionoptions",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>extends</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#barcodeoptions\">BarcodeOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ isAll = false ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否返回全部结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>isAll</code> 只影响 <code>barcode(...)</code>, <code>detect(...)</code> 和 <code>recognizeText(...)</code>. <code>detectAll(...)</code> 和 <code>recognizeTexts(...)</code> 始终返回数组.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "BarcodeSelectionOptions"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "BarcodeFormat",
          "name": "barcodeformat",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>条码格式可使用数值或名称. 名称不区分大小写, 非字母数字字符会转换为 <code>_</code>, <code>FORMAT_</code> 前缀可省略. <code>QRCODE</code> 会转换为 <code>QR_CODE</code>.</p>\n<p>支持的格式:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">数值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ALL</code>, <code>ALL_FORMATS</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CODE_128</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CODE_39</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CODE_93</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>4</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CODABAR</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>8</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DATA_MATRIX</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>16</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EAN_13</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>32</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EAN_8</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ITF</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>128</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>QR_CODE</code>, <code>QRCODE</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>256</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UPC_A</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>512</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UPC_E</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>1024</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PDF417</code>, <code>PDF_417</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>2048</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AZTEC</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>4096</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>未知的字符串格式会抛出异常. 数值格式会先转换为 32 位整数再传给插件, 非整数向 <code>0</code> 截断; 非有限值或超出 32 位整数范围的值会抛出异常. 应使用表中的受支持值.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "BarcodeFormat"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[C] WrappedBarcode",
          "name": "[c]_wrappedbarcode",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>WrappedBarcode</code> 是 <code>detect()</code> 和 <code>detectAll()</code> 返回的条码结果包装类. 普通脚本不应直接构造该类.</p>\n<p>从 AutoJs6 6.8.0 起, 底层结果来自外置插件的 AIDL <code>BarcodeResult</code>, 结构化数据由 JSON 载荷提供.</p>\n",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] WrappedBarcode#barcode",
              "name": "[p#]_wrappedbarcode#barcode",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong> <strong><code>Getter</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <code>org.autojs.plugin.mlkit.barcode.api.BarcodeResult</code> } - 插件返回的底层结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>底层结果包含 <code>rawValue</code>, <code>displayValue</code>, <code>rawBytes</code>, <code>format</code>, <code>formatName</code>, <code>valueType</code>, <code>valueTypeName</code>, <code>boundingBox</code>, <code>cornerPoints</code> 和 <code>extras</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] WrappedBarcode#barcode"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] WrappedBarcode#value",
              "name": "[p#]_wrappedbarcode#value",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Getter</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 显示值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#m-wrappedbarcodegetdisplayvalue\"><code>getDisplayValue()</code></a> 的属性形式.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] WrappedBarcode#value"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getFormat()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getformat()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 条码格式数值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回结果的格式数值, 对应 <a href=\"#barcodeformat\">BarcodeFormat</a> 表.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getFormat()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getFormatName()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getformatname()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 条码格式名称</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回带 <code>FORMAT_</code> 前缀的规范名称. 无法识别格式时返回 <code>&quot;FORMAT_NAME_UNKNOWN&quot;</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getFormatName()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getValueType()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getvaluetype()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 值类型数值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回条码内容的值类型.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getValueType()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getType()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#gettype()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 值类型数值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#m-wrappedbarcodegetvaluetype\"><code>getValueType()</code></a> 的别名.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getType()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getValueTypeName()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getvaluetypename()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 值类型名称</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回带 <code>TYPE_</code> 前缀的规范名称.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getValueTypeName()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getTypeName()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#gettypename()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 值类型名称</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>getValueTypeName()</code> 的别名. 无法识别类型时返回 <code>&quot;TYPE_NAME_UNKNOWN&quot;</code>.</p>\n<p>支持的值类型:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">数值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_UNKNOWN</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_CONTACT_INFO</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_EMAIL</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_ISBN</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_PHONE</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>4</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_PRODUCT</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>5</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_SMS</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>6</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_TEXT</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>7</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_URL</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>8</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_WIFI</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>9</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_GEO</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>10</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_CALENDAR_EVENT</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>11</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TYPE_DRIVER_LICENSE</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><code>12</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getTypeName()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getBoundingBox()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getboundingbox()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"androidRectType\">AndroidRect</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 条码外接矩形</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getBoundingBox()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getCornerPoints()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getcornerpoints()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/Point\">android.graphics.Point</a><a href=\"dataTypes#array\">[]</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 条码角点数组</li>\n</ul>\n<p>插件返回的扁平坐标会按 <code>(x, y)</code> 两个一组转换为 Android Point.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getCornerPoints()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getDisplayValue()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getdisplayvalue()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 便于显示的格式化值</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getDisplayValue()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getRawValue()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getrawvalue()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 条码原始文本</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>recognizeText()</code> 和 <code>recognizeTexts()</code> 使用此值.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getRawValue()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getRawBytes()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getrawbytes()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#bytearray\">ByteArray</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 条码原始字节</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getRawBytes()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getCalendarEvent()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getcalendarevent()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 日历事件结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getCalendarEvent()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getContactInfo()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getcontactinfo()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 联系人结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getContactInfo()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getDriverLicense()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getdriverlicense()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 驾照结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getDriverLicense()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getEmail()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getemail()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 邮件结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getEmail()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getGeoPoint()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getgeopoint()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 经纬度结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getGeoPoint()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getPhone()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getphone()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 电话结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getPhone()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getSms()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getsms()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 短信结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getSms()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getUrl()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#geturl()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - URL 结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getUrl()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getWifi()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#getwifi()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/org/json/JSONObject\">org.json.JSONObject</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - Wi-Fi 结构化数据</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上述结构化方法只在条码类型与方法匹配且插件提供对应 JSON 对象时返回数据, 其他情况返回 <code>null</code>. 对象字段由当前插件结果决定.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#getWifi()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#toString()",
              "name": "[m#]_wrappedbarcode#tostring()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 结果摘要</li>\n</ul>\n<p>摘要格式为 <code>[FORMAT] &lt;TYPE&gt; displayValue</code>, 其中格式名和类型名会移除 <code>FORMAT_</code> 与 <code>TYPE_</code> 前缀.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let result = barcode.detect(&quot;./qrcode.png&quot;);\nif (result !== null) {\n    console.log(result.toString()); // [QR_CODE] &lt;TEXT&gt; example\n}\n</code></pre>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] WrappedBarcode#toString()"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[C] WrappedBarcode"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
      "displayName": "条码 (Barcode)"
    }
  ]
}